From 1c8c946367f85387610ed9e0a9fb08f760d31566 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 17:24:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 18/19] feat: discover on all suitable network interfaces

Join discovery groups on active multicast-capable interfaces and send
announcements from each usable IPv4 and IPv6 address. Track Linux link
and address notifications to maintain memberships after network changes.
Use packet metadata for probe replies so the selected interface and
advertised address match the path through which the device was reached.

Signed-off-by: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
